{
  "_comment": "Copy to .mcp.json (gitignored). Official Todoist MCP: hosted HTTP + OAuth. No token stored here; OAuth sign-in happens in-browser on first tool use. Do NOT also run `claude mcp add todoist ...` if this file exists — duplicate entries cause OAuth sign-in loops. (The scheduled-tasks feature no longer needs an MCP entry here — it's delivered by a self-armed in-session CronCreate loop; see the 'Scheduler self-arming' section of CLAUDE.md.)",
